&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;④　１株当たり情報に及ぼす影響&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 14px"&gt;
